    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/49ac197a98c99c7bdf82322ed0529c8d.avif?t=1746568804\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Enter the Universe</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five individuals find themselves entangled in a global conspiracy. As they settle conflict across the world, they are led to a truth that challenges the very fabric of their existence.\u00a0Experience a tale that crosses the boundaries between gospel and deception, and work with your allies in order to unravel the mysteries that <strong>lie</strong>\u00a0within <strong>Caelum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lie of Caelum: Spirit</strong> is a JRPG that focuses on engaging combat and a rich story. This title offers exploration, mini-games, some puzzles, and other elements that will appeal even to the most dedicated players. Immerse yourself in a mysterious world where the unexpected awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/442adee15fb1791b53e168d62323e41d.poster.avif?t=1746568804\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/442adee15fb1791b53e168d62323e41d.webm?t=1746568804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/442adee15fb1791b53e168d62323e41d.mp4?t=1746568804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support via Xinput</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a turn-based input combo battle system that can bring forth critical attacks or guard on demand based on input timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize each character's unique kit and grow with them as they unlock more of their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your own combat prowess with hi-octane combat and challenging bosses that take note of combat roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover equipment and other items that can either change playstyles or reinforce roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story along with side quests and minigames that correspond with the premise of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore secrets and lore waiting for the brave and adventurous to uncover.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/49ac197a98c99c7bdf82322ed0529c8d.avif?t=1746568804\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Enter the Universe</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five individuals find themselves entangled in a global conspiracy. As they settle conflict across the world, they are led to a truth that challenges the very fabric of their existence.\u00a0Experience a tale that crosses the boundaries between gospel and deception, and work with your allies in order to unravel the mysteries that <strong>lie</strong>\u00a0within <strong>Caelum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lie of Caelum: Spirit</strong> is a JRPG that focuses on engaging combat and a rich story. This title offers exploration, mini-games, some puzzles, and other elements that will appeal even to the most dedicated players. Immerse yourself in a mysterious world where the unexpected awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/442adee15fb1791b53e168d62323e41d.poster.avif?t=1746568804\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/442adee15fb1791b53e168d62323e41d.webm?t=1746568804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974510/extras/442adee15fb1791b53e168d62323e41d.mp4?t=1746568804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support via Xinput</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a turn-based input combo battle system that can bring forth critical attacks or guard on demand based on input timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize each character's unique kit and grow with them as they unlock more of their skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your own combat prowess with hi-octane combat and challenging bosses that take note of combat roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover equipment and other items that can either change playstyles or reinforce roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story along with side quests and minigames that correspond with the premise of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore secrets and lore waiting for the brave and adventurous to uncover.</p></li></ul>",
